posts.body:
Thank you very much,
@Slaughty
and
@Starmage
! So there's a Feedback Festival going on. That's actually a very cool idea hahaha.
This is an old thread and all the screens and info are from the outdated, alpha version. I'm a bit embarrassed ;;;
I should update it as soon as possible with the final version of the game.
In any case, thank you for giving the game a try and for your valuable feedback. I'm taking everything into consideration to improve as much as I can.
A small note about the shiny indicators, I only added them for things I consider important or are a part of the main quest. But for people who like exploring, there are also hidden spots and items. Actually, the chest from the small room was added mainly to make players aware of this, since it needs a key that's initially hidden (albeit easy to find.)
